      "widgets_values": [
        "One coherent cinematic 3D animated preschool film environment, wide 16:9 horizontal frame, camera on the FAMILY GARDEN SIDE looking diagonally toward a DAIRY PADDOCK in morning light. In the near foreground, a few softly blurred leaves frame the lower corners. In the garden acting area, a woven mat and toddler floor cushion are left of a low oak discovery table; a shaded wooden bench is right of the table. One sealed ready-to-drink milk bottle stands on the table. Leave clear uncluttered places for seated Mother on the right bench and kneeling Alice on the left cushion. Several metres beyond the family area stands a CLOSED WOODEN CATTLE ENCLOSURE: a continuous front fence with visible vertical posts, plus a left return fence and a right return fence receding away from camera. The three connected fence sides make the interior of the pen unmistakable. The closed gate is part of the front fence. Exactly TWO black-and-white adult dairy cows are DEEP INSIDE the pen, several metres behind its front fence. Cow A stands side-on near an open-sided timber milking shelter on the pen's left rear; Cow B grazes farther away toward the pen's right rear and appears smaller because of depth. Every rail and post of the front fence stays visibly in FRONT of both complete cow silhouettes. Both cows have natural anatomy, four grounded legs and all hooves on the interior pasture grass. Their heads remain well behind the fence; no cow touches a rail or reaches through it. The distant red barn and soft tree line form a quiet far background with reduced contrast. Consistent perspective, believable object scale, warm light from upper left and grounded soft shadows; film composition with clear foreground, garden acting area, fence barrier, inner pen and distant landscape. No people yet, no third cow, no animal on the garden side, no cow head through rails, no indoor room, no floating props, no lettering, no logo, no collage and no watermark."
